<title>RUSSIA: Russia's ARS sees De Beers deal by May 1.</title>
<headline>Russia's ARS sees De Beers deal by May 1.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>A stalled gem deal between Russian diamond producer Almazy-Rossii-Sakha (ARS) and De Beers is expected to be approved by the Russian government no later than May 1, an ARS spokesman said on Thursday.</p>
<p>&quot;From April 14 add another 10 days, and then no later than May 1,&quot; said ARS spokesman Valentin Logunov, when asked when he expected the deal to be signed by the government.</p>
</text>
